derivation · gridDurMs…holdMs (all 9 durations) → schedule() phase starts · easeGrid/easeStrikes/easeDrop/easeLabels/easeTasks/easeFinal → ease() at their phases (easeStrikes also drives sweep3P — one key, two sequential sweeps of the same mark class, named) · palette.bg/ink/faint/panel/strike → bg rect / text + timeline / struck numerals / panel strokes / marks (nested keys, all resolved).
